<title>JAPAN: Bank of Kyoto - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Kyoto - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    64.73		vs	   77.22</p>
<p> Operating	   17.38		vs	   22.18</p>
<p> Current		1.71		vs	    6.61</p>
<p> Net		    1.60		vs	    2.32</p>
<p> EPS		    4.81 yen	  vs	    8.05 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    332 million	  vs	 289 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of Kyoto Ltd is a regional bank.</p>
